---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHero from '../../components/PageHero.astro';
import RFQForm from '../../components/RFQForm.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
import { company } from '../../data/company';
---
<BaseLayout title="About Titanium Parts | Manufacturer & Engineering Supplier" description="Titanium Parts is a factory-direct manufacturer and engineering supplier of titanium products, titanium anodes, and PEM electrolyzer systems.">
<PageHero eyebrow="About" title="About Titanium Parts" description="Factory-direct titanium products, anodes, and PEM electrolyzer systems for OEMs, EPC contractors, and system integrators worldwide." />
<section class="section section-white"><div class="container"><div class="about-intro"><div><span class="section-title-eyebrow">Who We Are</span><h2>Titanium Products Manufacturer &amp; Engineering Supplier</h2><p>Titanium Parts is a factory-direct titanium products manufacturer and engineering supplier for global OEMs, EPC contractors, and system integrators. Our capability builds in three layers: titanium materials as the traceable foundation; MMO titanium anodes as the value-added layer; and complete PEM electrolyzer systems for green hydrogen as the advanced layer — all built in-house.</p><p>Our capabilities have expanded from traceable titanium materials and CNC machining to custom MMO / platinized titanium anodes and PEM electrolyzer systems.</p></div><div class="about-stats"><div class="about-stat"><div class="about-stat-num">10+</div><div class="about-stat-label">Years Experience</div></div><div class="about-stat"><div class="about-stat-num">3</div><div class="about-stat-label">Manufacturing Hubs</div></div><div class="about-stat"><div class="about-stat-num">100%</div><div class="about-stat-label">Traceable Quality</div></div><div class="about-stat"><div class="about-stat-num">50+</div><div class="about-stat-label">Application Scenarios</div></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section section-slate-50"><div class="container"><div class="section-header"><span class="section-title-eyebrow">Company Identity</span><h2 class="section-title">One Brand, Three Connected Product Businesses</h2></div><p class="identity-text">Titanium Parts is the international industrial brand of Ningbo Alto Nanotag Technology Co., Ltd. The business began in 2013 and developed from titanium materials and custom fabrication into titanium anodes, electrochemical solutions and PEM hydrogen systems.</p><div class="snapshot-grid"><div class="snapshot-card"><h3>What We Manufacture</h3><p>Titanium materials, CNC titanium components, custom titanium anodes, PEM electrolyzer stacks, and integrated PEM electrolyzer systems.</p></div><div class="snapshot-card"><h3>Who We Serve</h3><p>Global OEMs, EPC teams, system integrators, hydrogen developers, water treatment companies, and industrial project buyers.</p></div><div class="snapshot-card"><h3>Why Buyers Choose Us</h3><p>Factory-direct supply, custom engineering, traceable quality documents, application-specific support, and long-term project cooperation.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section section-white"><div class="container"><div class="section-header"><span class="section-title-eyebrow">Milestones</span><h2 class="section-title">A Decade of Capability Growth</h2><p class="section-desc">Our journey is defined by continuous engineering development. Over the past decade, we have expanded from titanium material processing into coordinated electrochemical and hydrogen product capabilities.</p></div><div class="timeline"><div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-year">2013</div><div class="timeline-content"><h3>Foundation in Baoji Titanium Valley</h3><p>Built our manufacturing foundation in titanium materials and precision processing.</p></div></div><div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-year">2016</div><div class="timeline-content"><h3>Electrochemical Anode Production</h3><p>Launched MMO and platinized titanium anode production for water treatment and corrosion protection.</p></div></div><div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-year">2019</div><div class="timeline-content"><h3>Cathodic Protection Expansion</h3><p>Extended anode portfolio to ICCP anodes, sacrificial anodes, and reference electrodes.</p></div></div><div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-year">2022</div><div class="timeline-content"><h3>PEM Hydrogen Systems</h3><p>Entered the green hydrogen sector with PEM electrolyzer stacks and integrated systems.</p></div></div><div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-year">2024</div><div class="timeline-content"><h3>Connected Manufacturing Network</h3><p>Integrated Ningbo coordination with Baoji manufacturing and Dongguan PEM assembly.</p></div></div><div class="timeline-item"><div class="timeline-year">2026</div><div class="timeline-content"><h3>Global B2B Supply</h3><p>Supporting OEMs, EPC contractors, and system integrators worldwide with factory-direct supply.</p></div></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section section-slate-50"><div class="container"><div class="section-header"><span class="section-title-eyebrow">Strategic Pillars</span><h2 class="section-title">The TITANIUM PARTS Advantage</h2><p class="section-desc">Beyond manufacturing, we reduce procurement uncertainty by defining the supply scope, technical basis, inspection points, and required documents.</p></div><div class="pillars-grid"><div class="pillar-card"><div class="pillar-num">01</div><h3>Connected Manufacturing Scope</h3><p>Across titanium materials, CNC machining, custom anodes, and PEM systems.</p></div><div class="pillar-card"><div class="pillar-num">02</div><h3>Application-Specific Engineering</h3><p>We review materials, coatings, geometry, documentation, and system configuration.</p></div><div class="pillar-card"><div class="pillar-num">03</div><h3>Order-Specific Quality Control</h3><p>Defined production and inspection checkpoints support traceability and consistency.</p></div><div class="pillar-card"><div class="pillar-num">04</div><h3>Global OEM Supply Support</h3><p>We support OEMs, EPC teams, and system integrators with delivery planning and export documents.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section section-white"><div class="container"><div class="section-header"><span class="section-title-eyebrow">OEM and Project Collaboration</span><h2 class="section-title">From Technical Review to Documented Delivery</h2></div><div class="process-grid"><div class="process-step"><div class="process-num">01</div><h3>Define the order basis</h3><p>Review application, specifications, drawings, interfaces and the proposed supply boundary.</p></div><div class="process-step"><div class="process-num">02</div><h3>Coordinate manufacturing</h3><p>Match the product family to the relevant process route, inspection points and documentation plan.</p></div><div class="process-step"><div class="process-num">03</div><h3>Release with evidence</h3><p>Confirm the records, test results, packing and handover documents required by the project.</p></div><div class="process-step"><div class="process-num">04</div><h3>Support production & delivery</h3><p>For approved projects, we coordinate production, inspection, packing, export documents, and shipment follow-up.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section section-dark"><div class="container"><div class="rfq-grid"><div><span class="section-title-eyebrow" style="color: var(--color-primary-200);">Talk with the Titanium Parts Team</span><h2 class="rfq-title">If you are evaluating Titanium Parts as a supplier, tell us the product family, project scope and approval requirements.</h2><ul class="rfq-benefits"><li><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#4ADE80" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg> Product family and application</li><li><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#4ADE80" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg> Technical or drawing requirements</li><li><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#4ADE80" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg> Inspection and supplier-approval needs</li><li><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#4ADE80" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg> Project timing and next decision</li></ul><p class="rfq-prefer">Prefer email? <a href="mailto:sales@titanium-parts.com">sales@titanium-parts.com</a></p></div><RFQForm title="Project Inquiry" subtitle="Tell us what you are developing or sourcing." variant="default" /></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
